        "id": 1843125
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-24T17:18:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Completion of the MMU disable only needs an ISB. The important thing here is to ensure is that whatever we are executing afterwards (fw code as well as payload code) is cleaned from the caches to the point of coherency (PoC) as subsequent instruction fetches won\u0027t hit in unified caches between PoU and PoC.",
      "parentUuid": "6a875065_2c290d65",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 35,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 35,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "6a4e59a4f95889be0c754563581b240eca5b7882",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ff34458c_2e0f4d3f",
        "filename": "pvmfw/payload.S",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 36,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-11T10:48:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That feels a bit too drastic: can\u0027t we simply flip the bits we don\u0027t want (`M` and `C`, I suppose)?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "6a4e59a4f95889be0c754563581b240eca5b7882",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ad442083_d4bb23e1",
        "filename": "pvmfw/payload.S",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 36,
      "author": {
        "id": 1380243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-24T16:54:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seemed best to put it in a known state; won\u0027t the next stage U-Boot initialise it however it wants anyway?",
      "parentUuid": "ff34458c_2e0f4d3f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "6a4e59a4f95889be0c754563581b240eca5b7882",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b5bee953_7ef46eeb",
        "filename": "pvmfw/payload.S",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 36,
      "author": {
        "id": 1843125
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-24T17:18:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It also violates the architecture, as there are RES1 fields in some of those registers as well, and SCTLR_ELx has fields that have nothing to do with translation.\n\nBetter to only clear the M bit if disabling the MMU is what you are after.",
      "parentUuid": "ff34458c_2e0f4d3f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "6a4e59a4f95889be0c754563581b240eca5b7882",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
